# sweep: --bare --seed-root apps/tailscale/fixtures/sign-in
# The runtime has a sign-in link, so the app opens on the code for a phone
# with the address written out under it.
wait-for Scan with your phone
expect Approve this reader
expect Or open this address on any phone or computer:
expect 1a2b3c4d5e6f
expect The code works for ten minutes.
clean
shot tailscale-sign-in
# Back leaves the code, and the first screen offers it again.
tap-id 4294967295
wait-for This reader is waiting to be approved from your phone.
expect Waiting for approval
clean
shot tailscale-waiting
tap Approve this reader
wait-for Scan with your phone
